lothlorien.message.deer.restless=§7Bílý jelen se leká vašeho neklidného ducha.
## Context: White deer gift guidance needs Friend status (Harmony +10), even though a Guest can approach the deer. Acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.untrusted=§7Bílý jelen vás pozoruje, ale zatím vám nedůvěřuje.
## Context: Tooltip line 3. Plant the nut on grass or dirt. Full tooltip also explains giant tree and space requirements.
lothlorien.message.nut.lore.plant=§7Zasaďte na trávu nebo hlínu.
## Context: Tooltip line 2. Dimensions are Minecraft blocks: approximate width 40 and height 50. Full tooltip also explains giant tree and planting surface.
lothlorien.message.nut.lore.space=§7Potřebný prostor: šířka asi 40, výška 50.
## Context: Tooltip line 1 of gifted Great Mallorn nut. Flet means wooden platform in the giant tree. Full tooltip explains tree size and planting surface.
lothlorien.message.nut.lore.tree=§7Vyroste v obří mallorn s plošinou.
## Context: Mounting refused: unicorn is bonded to a different player.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.other_owner=§7Tento jednorožec je spjatý s někým jiným.
## Context: Third accepted offer creates a permanent bond to this player; now rideable without a saddle.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.trust3=§fJednorožec před vámi skloní roh. Nyní patří k vám; sedlo nepotřebuje.
## Context: Second accepted Elanor offer; flower consumed, trust stage 2 of 3.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.trust2=§fJednorožec vám vezme elanor z ruky.
## Context: First accepted Elanor offer; flower consumed, trust stage 1 of 3.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.trust1=§fJednorožec očichává elanor a pozoruje vás.
## Context: Less than ten seconds since previous offer; flower is kept. Turning over means examining, not rotating a block.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.wait=§7Jednorožec si ještě prohlíží květinu. Dopřejte mu chvilku.
## Context: Unicorn is alarmed and refuses the offer; flower is kept.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.alarmed=§7Jednorožec je příliš vystrašený, aby si cokoli vzal.
## Context: Player lacks Friend status (is a Guest, Harmony 0 to +9); flower is kept.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.untrusted=§7Jednorožec pozoruje květinu i vás, ale zatím vám nedůvěřuje.
## Context: Elanor offer refused because the player's Harmony is below 0 (Uneasy, Shunned or Hated band); flower is kept.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.restless=§7Jednorožec se leká vašeho neklidného ducha.
## Context: Friend status gained: the player's Harmony reached +10 inside Lothlorien after peaceful time. Gender-neutral announcement of woodland trust. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.friend.gained=§aLothlórien vás přijímá mezi své přátele.
## Context: Friend status lost: Harmony dropped below +10 after a deed (a kill). Gender-neutral announcement. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.friend.lost=§7Lothlórien vás už neřadí mezi své přátele.
## Context: Short action-bar label for the Friend band (Harmony +10), shown inside the forest. Use an impersonal friendship label to avoid assigning gender to the player. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.status.friend=Přízeň Lothlórienu
